 <div class="meta"><span class="status">SEMANTIC L3 · DESIGN PROBABLE · OPERATIONAL POTENTIAL</span><p><b>Purpose:</b> Define the classes of actionable work and queue states that preserve continuity from signal to accepted return.</p><p><b>Owns:</b> Work Object identity, bounded objective, queue position, owner, dependencies, authority, evidence, next action and return.</p><p><b>Does not own:</b> Underlying element definitions, operational truth outside authorised registers or authority itself.</p><p><b>Boundary:</b> design definitions and instance taxonomies only. Odoo remains operational truth. No operational metrics or mutable record detail is duplicated here.</p></div>
